Project Title:- Superstore Sales Analysis Dashboard

Tools Used:

Power BI

Excel/CSV dataset

Project Description:
This project presents an interactive sales dashboard that analyzes performance by month, region, and product category. The dashboard helps identify sales trends, top-performing regions, and leading product categories.

Key Features:

Line chart showing monthly sales trend

Bar chart comparing sales by region

Donut chart displaying sales by category

Region slicer for interactive filtering

Insights:

West region recorded the highest sales.

Technology category contributed the most revenue.

Sales showed an upward trend toward the end of the year.
